<title>JAPAN: PLDT launches $200 mln global bond-Goldman.</title>
<headline>PLDT launches $200 mln global bond-Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following global bond issue was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs on Monday:</p>
<p>    BORROWER Philippine Long Distance Telephone</p>
<p>    AMT	$200 million</p>
<p>    MATURITY 6 March 2007  </p>
<p> PAY DATE	  6 March 1997</p>
<p> LAST RATING     S&amp;P BB+, Moody's BA2</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Goldman Sachs, Citicorp</p>
<p>NOTES: Price talk is 150-155 basis points over the 6.25 percent U.S. Treasury bond due in February 2007. Final price to be decided on February 25 in New York time. ---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-5473-3748</p>
</text>
